{"pull": {"id": "number:21560", "number": 21560, "title": "KAFKA-20168: Downgrade Jetty from 12.0.32 to 12.0.25 to fix SLF4J 2.x incompatibility (4.2)", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-02-24T09:29:44Z", "closed_at": "2026-02-25T05:31:32Z", "merged_at": null, "user": {"login": "mingyen066", "id": 6782723, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODI3MjM=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6782723?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066", "html_url": "https://github.com/mingyen066", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mingyen066/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Jetty 12.0.30+ introduced SLF4J 2.x fluent API usage (`Logger.atDebug()`) which causes `NoSuchMethodError` at runtime since Kafka still uses SLF4J 1.7.x. Downgrade to 12.0.25 which includes the CVE-2025-5115 fix without the SLF4J 2.x incompatibility.\n\nThe issue was discovered and discussed in https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21452#issuecomment-3943544053.\n\ntrunk: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21559", "labels": [], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/21560"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/Cherry-pick_is_pr.json"}